{"ref":"BDB, בַּעֲנָה","hw":"בַּעֲנָה","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">בַּעֲנָה</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m. (</strong>? <em>id.</em><strong>)</strong>—<br><strong>1.</strong>  a Benjamite, one of the murderers of Ishbosheth <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 4:2\" href=\"/II_Samuel.4.2\">2 S 4:2</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 4:5\" href=\"/II_Samuel.4.5\">5</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 4:6\" href=\"/II_Samuel.4.6\">6</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 4:9\" href=\"/II_Samuel.4.9\">9</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  father of one of David’s heroes <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 23:29\" href=\"/II_Samuel.23.29\">2 S 23:29</a> = <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 11:30\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.11.30\">1 Ch 11:30</a>.<br><strong>3.</strong>  head of a family of returning exiles <a data-ref=\"Ezra 2:2\" href=\"/Ezra.2.2\">Ezr 2:2</a> = <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 7:7\" href=\"/Nehemiah.7.7\">Ne 7:7</a>; perhaps also = <span dir=\"rtl\">בַּעֲנָא</span> <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 3:4\" href=\"/Nehemiah.3.4\">Ne 3:4</a><br><strong>4.</strong>  a chief of the people <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 10:28\" href=\"/Nehemiah.10.28\">Ne 10:28</a>.","next":"BDB, בָּעַר","prev":"BDB, בַּעֲנָא"}